---
import '@fontsource-variable/archivo';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/400.css';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/500.css';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/600.css';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/700.css';

const title = 'Calculadora de recargos nocturnos, dominicales y festivos 2026';
const description = 'Calcula gratis cuánto se paga por turnos nocturnos, dominicales y festivos con los porcentajes vigentes de la reforma laboral (Ley 2466 de 2025).';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://atelier.geosdata.com/soluciones/calculadora-recargos-2026/" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="es_CO" />
    <title>{title} · Geosdata</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page">
      <header class="top">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3 3 8l9 5 9-5-9-5z"/><path d="M3 13l9 5 9-5"/></svg></span>
          <span class="mark">GEOSDATA</span>
        </a>
        <a class="back" href="/">← Inicio</a>
      </header>

      <main class="tool">
        <section class="intro">
          <span class="eyebrow">reforma laboral</span>
          <h1>¿Cuánto cuesta abrir de noche, un domingo o un festivo?</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Liquidar los recargos a mano en Excel es donde más se paga de menos (o de más). Con la reforma laboral
            cambiaron los porcentajes y la hora en que empieza el recargo nocturno. Pon tus números y ve el recargo real.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="calculator">
          <form id="recargos-form" class="rec-form" novalidate>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="salary">Salario mensual del empleado (COP)</label>
              <input type="number" id="salary" name="salary" min="0" step="1000" placeholder="1300000" required />
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="period">Periodo</label>
              <select id="period" name="period">
                <option value="until_jun_2026">Enero a junio 2026 (dominical/festivo 80% · hora ÷ 220)</option>
                <option value="from_jul_2026" selected>Desde julio 2026 (dominical/festivo 90% · hora ÷ 210)</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <p class="group-title">Recargos <span>(trabajo dentro de la jornada)</span></p>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="nightHours">Horas nocturnas entre semana <span>(7pm–6am, 35%)</span></label>
              <input type="number" id="nightHours" name="nightHours" min="0" step="0.5" placeholder="0" />
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="sundayDayHours">Horas dominical/festivo diurnas</label>
              <input type="number" id="sundayDayHours" name="sundayDayHours" min="0" step="0.5" placeholder="0" />
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="sundayNightHours">Horas dominical/festivo nocturnas <span>(se suman los dos recargos)</span></label>
              <input type="number" id="sundayNightHours" name="sundayNightHours" min="0" step="0.5" placeholder="0" />
            </div>

            <p class="group-title">Horas extra <span>(por encima de la jornada · máx 2/día, 12/semana)</span></p>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="extraDay">Horas extra diurnas <span>(6am–7pm, 25%)</span></label>
              <input type="number" id="extraDay" name="extraDay" min="0" step="0.5" placeholder="0" />
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="extraNight">Horas extra nocturnas <span>(7pm–6am, 75%)</span></label>
              <input type="number" id="extraNight" name="extraNight" min="0" step="0.5" placeholder="0" />
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="extraSundayDay">Horas extra dominical/festivo diurnas</label>
              <input type="number" id="extraSundayDay" name="extraSundayDay" min="0" step="0.5" placeholder="0" />
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="extraSundayNight">Horas extra dominical/festivo nocturnas</label>
              <input type="number" id="extraSundayNight" name="extraSundayNight" min="0" step="0.5" placeholder="0" />
            </div>

            <button type="submit">Calcular</button>
          </form>

          <div id="recargos-result" class="rec-result" hidden></div>
        </section>

        <section id="hook" class="hook" hidden>
          <p>
            <a href="https://geosdata.com/contact/">¿Te falta algo? Cuéntanos qué necesitas y puede ser la próxima herramienta.</a>
          </p>
          <a class="hook-cta" href="https://geosdata.com/contact/">Contacto</a>
        </section>

        <section class="notes">
          <h2>Qué cambió con la reforma laboral (Ley 2466 de 2025)</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Recargo nocturno 35%</strong>, y la jornada nocturna ahora empieza a las <strong>7:00 p.m.</strong> (antes 9:00 p.m.).</li>
            <li><strong>Recargo dominical y festivo escalonado:</strong> 80% hasta junio 2026, <strong>90% desde julio 2026</strong>, 100% desde julio 2027.</li>
            <li>Si el turno es dominical/festivo <em>y</em> nocturno, los dos recargos se suman sobre la hora ordinaria.</li>
            <li><strong>Jornada de 42 horas</strong> desde el 15 de julio de 2026 (Ley 2101 de 2021). La hora ordinaria es el salario mensual ÷ <strong>210</strong> (42 × 30 ÷ 6). De enero al 14 de julio de 2026 la jornada era de 44 horas y el divisor es <strong>220</strong>.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="worked">
            <strong>Ejemplo.</strong> Salario de $1.300.000 y 8 horas nocturnas entre semana.
            Desde el 15 de julio de 2026 la hora ordinaria es $1.300.000 ÷ 210 = <strong>$6.190</strong> y el recargo del 35% es <strong>$17.333</strong>.
            De enero a junio de 2026 la misma cuenta usa ÷ 220: hora ordinaria <strong>$5.909</strong> y recargo <strong>$16.545</strong>.
          </p>
          <p class="disclaimer">
            Esta herramienta calcula <strong>recargos</strong> por trabajo nocturno, dominical y festivo. No incluye
            prestaciones sociales. El periodo «desde julio» aplica el divisor 210, que corresponde a la jornada de 42
            horas vigente desde el 15 de julio; del 1 al 14 de julio de 2026 la jornada seguía en 44 horas (÷ 220).
            Cálculo orientativo: antes de liquidar la nómina, contrasta el resultado con el texto oficial y las fechas
            de vigencia en las fuentes del Ministerio del Trabajo.
          </p>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer class="foot">
        <span class="mark">GEOSDATA</span>
        <p>Productos digitales enfocados en problemas comunes.</p>
        <span class="foot-mono">geosdata.com</span>
      </footer>
    </div>

    <script is:inline>
      const NIGHT_RATE = 0.35;
      const EXTRA_DAY_RATE = 0.25;
      const EXTRA_NIGHT_RATE = 0.75;
      const MONTHLY_HOURS_44_WEEK = 220;
      const MONTHLY_HOURS_42_WEEK = 210;
      const WEEKLY_EXTRA_LIMIT = 12;

      const monthlyHours = (period) => (period === 'from_jul_2026' ? MONTHLY_HOURS_42_WEEK : MONTHLY_HOURS_44_WEEK);

      const money = (value) =>
        new Intl.NumberFormat('es-CO', { style: 'currency', currency: 'COP', maximumFractionDigits: 0 }).format(Math.round(value));

      const percent = (rate) => `${Math.round(rate * 100)}%`;

      const number = (form, name) => {
        const raw = parseFloat(form.elements[name].value);
        return Number.isFinite(raw) && raw > 0 ? raw : 0;
      };

      function compute(input) {
        const hourlyDivisor = monthlyHours(input.period);
        const hourlyRate = input.monthlySalary / hourlyDivisor;
        const sundayRate = input.period === 'from_jul_2026' ? 0.9 : 0.8;
        const surcharges = {
          night: input.nightHours * hourlyRate * NIGHT_RATE,
          sundayDay: input.sundayDayHours * hourlyRate * sundayRate,
          sundayNight: input.sundayNightHours * hourlyRate * (sundayRate + NIGHT_RATE),
        };
        const overtime = {
          extraDay: input.extraDay * hourlyRate * (1 + EXTRA_DAY_RATE),
          extraNight: input.extraNight * hourlyRate * (1 + EXTRA_NIGHT_RATE),
          extraSundayDay: input.extraSundayDay * hourlyRate * (1 + sundayRate + EXTRA_DAY_RATE),
          extraSundayNight: input.extraSundayNight * hourlyRate * (1 + sundayRate + EXTRA_NIGHT_RATE),
        };
        const surchargeTotal = surcharges.night + surcharges.sundayDay + surcharges.sundayNight;
        const overtimeTotal = overtime.extraDay + overtime.extraNight + overtime.extraSundayDay + overtime.extraSundayNight;
        const extraHours = input.extraDay + input.extraNight + input.extraSundayDay + input.extraSundayNight;
        return { hourlyRate, hourlyDivisor, sundayRate, surcharges, overtime, total: surchargeTotal + overtimeTotal, extraHours };
      }

      function renderResult(result, input, output) {
        const rows = [
          input.nightHours > 0 && [`Recargo nocturno (${input.nightHours} h × 35%)`, output.surcharges.night],
          input.sundayDayHours > 0 && [`Recargo dominical/festivo diurno (${input.sundayDayHours} h × ${percent(output.sundayRate)})`, output.surcharges.sundayDay],
          input.sundayNightHours > 0 && [`Recargo dominical/festivo nocturno (${input.sundayNightHours} h × ${percent(output.sundayRate + NIGHT_RATE)})`, output.surcharges.sundayNight],
          input.extraDay > 0 && [`Hora extra diurna (${input.extraDay} h × 125%)`, output.overtime.extraDay],
          input.extraNight > 0 && [`Hora extra nocturna (${input.extraNight} h × 175%)`, output.overtime.extraNight],
          input.extraSundayDay > 0 && [`Hora extra dominical/festivo diurna (${input.extraSundayDay} h × ${percent(1 + output.sundayRate + EXTRA_DAY_RATE)})`, output.overtime.extraSundayDay],
          input.extraSundayNight > 0 && [`Hora extra dominical/festivo nocturna (${input.extraSundayNight} h × ${percent(1 + output.sundayRate + EXTRA_NIGHT_RATE)})`, output.overtime.extraSundayNight],
        ].filter(Boolean);

        let html = `<div class="line"><span>Valor hora ordinaria (salario ÷ ${output.hourlyDivisor})</span><b>${money(output.hourlyRate)}</b></div>`;
        html += rows.map(([label, value]) => `<div class="line"><span>${label}</span><b>${money(value)}</b></div>`).join('');
        html += `<div class="line total"><span>Total adicional al salario base</span><b>${money(output.total)}</b></div>`;
        if (output.extraHours > WEEKLY_EXTRA_LIMIT) {
          html += `<p class="warn">Ojo: ${output.extraHours} horas extra superan el tope legal de 12 por semana (Art. 167-A CST).</p>`;
        }
        result.innerHTML = html;
        result.hidden = false;
      }

      const form = document.getElementById('recargos-form');
      const result = document.getElementById('recargos-result');
      const hook = document.getElementById('hook');

      form.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
        event.preventDefault();
        const monthlySalary = number(form, 'salary');
        if (monthlySalary <= 0) {
          result.innerHTML = '<div class="line"><span>Ingresa un salario mensual válido.</span></div>';
          result.hidden = false;
          return;
        }
        const input = {
          monthlySalary,
          period: form.elements['period'].value,
          nightHours: number(form, 'nightHours'),
          sundayDayHours: number(form, 'sundayDayHours'),
          sundayNightHours: number(form, 'sundayNightHours'),
          extraDay: number(form, 'extraDay'),
          extraNight: number(form, 'extraNight'),
          extraSundayDay: number(form, 'extraSundayDay'),
          extraSundayNight: number(form, 'extraSundayNight'),
        };
        renderResult(result, input, compute(input));
        hook.hidden = false;
      });

    </script>

    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --paper: #f1f1ec; --paper-2: #eceae3; --ink: #17201b; --ink-soft: #5b625b;
        --line: #d5d4cb; --accent: #0f6e4e; --accent-ink: #0a4d36; --accent-soft: #e2ede7; --warn: #8a5109;
        --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, "Consolas", monospace;
        --font-sans: 'Archivo Variable', system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        --wrap: 780px;
      }
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
      body { background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-sans); line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }

      .top { max-width: var(--wrap); margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2rem); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .brand { text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; }
      .brand-mark { display: inline-flex; color: var(--accent-ink); }
      .brand-mark svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
      .mark { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1rem; }
      .back { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; }
      .back:hover { color: var(--accent-ink); }

      .tool { max-width: var(--wrap); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2rem) 5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.5rem; }
      .eyebrow { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--ink-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper); padding: 0.28rem 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.7rem); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; text-wrap: balance; }
      .lead { font-size: 1.08rem; color: #2c332c; max-width: 60ch; }

      .rec-form { display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--ink); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--ink); padding: 1.8rem; }
      .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; }
      .field label { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .field label span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); }
      .group-title { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0.6rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .group-title span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 400; }
      .warn { margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--warn); font-size: 0.85rem; }
      input, select, textarea { font-family: var(--font-mono); padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); font-size: 0.95rem; width: 100%; }
      input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: -1px; }
      button { font-family: var(--font-mono); padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; justify-self: start; }
      button:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--accent-ink); }
      button:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; }

      .rec-result { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--ink); padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; }
      .rec-result .line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 0.55rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 0.92rem; }
      .rec-result .line:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .rec-result .line span { color: var(--ink-soft); }
      .rec-result .line b { color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
      .rec-result .total { margin-top: 0.4rem; padding-top: 0.9rem; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line) !important; font-size: 1.05rem; }
      .rec-result .total b { color: var(--accent-ink); font-size: 1.15rem; }

      .hook { background: var(--accent-soft); border: 1px solid var(--accent); padding: 1.8rem; }
      .hook p { color: #2c332c; }
      .hook p a { color: var(--accent-ink); font-weight: 600; }
      .hook-cta { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.1rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-decoration: none; }
      .hook-cta:hover { background: var(--accent-ink); }

      .notes h2 { color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
      .notes ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; display: grid; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: #2c332c; }
      .notes strong { color: var(--ink); }
      .worked { color: #2c332c; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
      .disclaimer { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 1rem; }

      .foot { max-width: var(--wrap); margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2rem) 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .foot p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.86rem; flex: 1; min-width: 180px; }
      .foot-mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--ink-soft); }

      a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 3px; }

    </style>
  </body>
</html>
